{"seq":3,"slug":"web-vitals-performance","title":"Web Vitals 与性能度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/web-vitals-performance","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"web-vitals-与性能度量\">Web Vitals 与性能度量</h1><p>2024 年 3 月 INP 替代 FID 成为 Core Web Vital 后，全球移动站点的通过率从 93%（FID 时代）骤降至约 65%——INP 度量完整交互生命周期（输入延迟 + 处理时间 + 呈现延迟），暴露了 FID 遮掩的大量响应性问题。2026 年三项阈值未变：LCP &lt; 2.5s、INP &lt; 200ms、CLS &lt; 0.1，但 AI 搜索引擎（ChatGPT、Perplexity）开始将页面速度作为引用信号——FCP &lt; 0.4s 的页面平均获得 6.7 次 AI 引用，&gt; 1.13s 的仅 2.1 次。性能度量不再只关乎 SEO 排名，更关乎 AI 时代的内容可见性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能度量的基本术语界定了“测哪一个指标、在哪一层测”：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在度量中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LCP</td>\n<td>最大内容绘制时间</td>\n<td>加载速度的核心指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INP</td>\n<td>交互到下一次绘制延迟</td>\n<td>交互响应的核心指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLS</td>\n<td>累计布局偏移</td>\n<td>视觉稳定的核心指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P75</td>\n<td>第 75 百分位</td>\n<td>CrUX 的评估口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lab vs Field</td>\n<td>受控模拟 vs 真实用户</td>\n<td>两类数据不可互换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>attribution</td>\n<td>web-vitals 提供的归因信息</td>\n<td>从数值到可行动项的桥梁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PerformanceObserver</td>\n<td>采集 Long Animation Frames 等原语</td>\n<td>自定义度量的技术底座</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三项 Core Web Vitals（LCP/INP/CLS）是排名信号，其余（TTFB/FCP/TBT/TTI）是诊断用途的辅助指标——区分这两类是避免“为不是排名的指标过度优化”的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"core-web-vitals-完整指标体系\">Core Web Vitals 完整指标体系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>度量维度</th>\n<th>好</th>\n<th>需改进</th>\n<th>差</th>\n<th>P75 评估</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LCP</td>\n<td>Largest Contentful Paint</td>\n<td>加载速度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 2.5s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5s - 4.0s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 4.0s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INP</td>\n<td>Interaction to Next Paint</td>\n<td>交互响应</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 200ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>500</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200ms - 500ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>500</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 500ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLS</td>\n<td>Cumulative Layout Shift</td>\n<td>视觉稳定</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1 - 0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>辅助指标（诊断用途，非排名信号）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TTFB</td>\n<td>服务器响应速度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>800</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 800ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FCP</td>\n<td>首次内容绘制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.8</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 1.8s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TBT</td>\n<td>总阻塞时间（Lab）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 200ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTI</td>\n<td>可交互时间（Lab）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3.8</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 3.8s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"inp-深度解析\">INP 深度解析</h2><p>INP 是 2026 年多数站点失败的 Web Vital。它度量页面生命周期内所有交互中最慢那一次（50+ 次交互取 P98）的完整延迟：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>INP</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Input Delay</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Processing Time</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Presentation Delay</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{INP} = \\text{Input Delay} + \\text{Processing Time} + \\text{Presentation Delay}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">INP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input Delay</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Processing Time</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Presentation Delay</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户点击] --&gt; B[Input Delay&lt;br/&gt;主线程忙,排队等待]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Processing Time&lt;br/&gt;事件处理器执行]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Presentation Delay&lt;br/&gt;样式计算 + 布局 + 绘制]&#10;    D --&gt; E[下一帧渲染]\">graph LR\n    A[用户点击] --&gt; B[Input Delay&lt;br/&gt;主线程忙,排队等待]\n    B --&gt; C[Processing Time&lt;br/&gt;事件处理器执行]\n    C --&gt; D[Presentation Delay&lt;br/&gt;样式计算 + 布局 + 绘制]\n    D --&gt; E[下一帧渲染]</pre><p>三个阶段各有优化策略：</p>\n<p><strong>Input Delay 优化</strong>——减少主线程长任务（&gt; 50ms）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>scheduler.yield()</code> 将长任务拆分为短块（2026 年浏览器已广泛支持）</li>\n<li>非可视工作（analytics、telemetry）移至 <code>requestIdleCallback</code> 或 Web Worker</li>\n<li>第三方脚本使用 <code>async</code>/<code>defer</code>，或通过 facade 模式延迟加载</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Processing Time 优化</strong>——加速事件处理器：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>事件处理器中避免同步 DOM 操作</li>\n<li>大数据列表使用虚拟滚动（仅渲染可视区域 DOM）</li>\n<li>状态更新批量合并（React 18+ 自动 batching）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Presentation Delay 优化</strong>——降低渲染成本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DOM 节点数控制在 1500 以下</li>\n<li>避免强制同步布局（读写分离：先批量读取布局属性，再批量写入样式）</li>\n<li>CSS <code>contain: layout</code> 隔离重排范围</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"性能度量的技术实现\">性能度量的技术实现</h2><h3 id=\"使用-web-vitals-库采集\">使用 web-vitals 库采集</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { onLCP, onINP, onCLS, onFCP, onTTFB } from &#39;web-vitals/attribution&#39;;&#10;&#10;function sendMetric(metric) {&#10;  const body = JSON.stringify({&#10;    name: metric.name,&#10;    value: metric.value,&#10;    rating: metric.rating,&#10;    delta: metric.delta,&#10;    id: metric.id,&#10;    attribution: metric.attribution,&#10;    navigationType: metric.navigationType,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  if (navigator.sendBeacon) {&#10;    navigator.sendBeacon(&#39;/api/vitals&#39;, body);&#10;  } else {&#10;    fetch(&#39;/api/vitals&#39;, { body, method: &#39;POST&#39;, keepalive: true });&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;onLCP(sendMetric);&#10;onINP(sendMetric);&#10;onCLS(sendMetric);&#10;onFCP(sendMetric);&#10;onTTFB(sendMetric);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { onLCP, onINP, onCLS, onFCP, onTTFB } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'web-vitals/attribution'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendMetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: metric.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    value: metric.value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rating: metric.rating,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    delta: metric.delta,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id: metric.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attribution: metric.attribution,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    navigationType: metric.navigationType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (navigator.sendBeacon) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    navigator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendBeacon</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { body, method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, keepalive: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onLCP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendMetric);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onINP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendMetric);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onCLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendMetric);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onFCP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendMetric);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onTTFB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendMetric);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>attribution</code> build 提供诊断归因信息——INP 会告诉你是哪个元素的哪次交互最慢，LCP 会告诉你 LCP 元素是什么以及各阶段耗时分解。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用-performanceobserver-自定义采集\">使用 PerformanceObserver 自定义采集</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 采集 Long Animation Frames（比 Long Tasks 更精确）&#10;const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    if (entry.duration &gt; 50) {&#10;      reportLongFrame({&#10;        duration: entry.duration,&#10;        blockingDuration: entry.blockingDuration,&#10;        scripts: entry.scripts.map((s) =&gt; ({&#10;          sourceURL: s.sourceURL,&#10;          sourceFunctionName: s.sourceFunctionName,&#10;          duration: s.duration,&#10;        })),&#10;      });&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;observer.observe({ type: &#39;long-animation-frame&#39;, buffered: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 采集 Long Animation Frames（比 Long Tasks 更精确）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry.duration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      reportLongFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        duration: entry.duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        blockingDuration: entry.blockingDuration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        scripts: entry.scripts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          sourceURL: s.sourceURL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          sourceFunctionName: s.sourceFunctionName,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          duration: s.duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'long-animation-frame'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能预算与回归守门\">性能预算与回归守门</h2><p>性能度量不是&quot;看看就好&quot;——它需要变成可执行的门控：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>触发点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>性能预算</td>\n<td>Lighthouse CI Budget</td>\n<td>PR merge 前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bundle Size 门控</td>\n<td><code>bundlesize</code> / Vite 配置</td>\n<td>Build 阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CrUX 回归告警</td>\n<td>Search Console + 自定义 RUM 告警</td>\n<td>持续监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真机回归</td>\n<td>WebPageTest API 自动化</td>\n<td>Release 前</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>性能预算示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;budgets&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;resourceType&quot;: &quot;script&quot;,&#10;      &quot;budget&quot;: 300000&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;resourceType&quot;: &quot;total&quot;,&#10;      &quot;budget&quot;: 800000&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;timings&quot;: [&#10;        { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;interactive&quot;, &quot;budget&quot;: 3800 },&#10;        { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;first-contentful-paint&quot;, &quot;budget&quot;: 1800 }&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"budgets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"resourceType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"script\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"resourceType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"timings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"interactive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"first-contentful-paint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"lcp-优化实战清单\">LCP 优化实战清单</h2><p>LCP 常见资源类型及对应优化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>LCP 元素类型</th>\n<th>占比</th>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 图片</td>\n<td>~72%</td>\n<td>WebP/AVIF 格式 + <code>fetchpriority=&quot;high&quot;</code> + 响应式 <code>srcset</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本块</td>\n<td>~18%</td>\n<td>关键 CSS 内联 + <code>font-display: optional</code> + preload 字体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;video&gt;</code> poster</td>\n<td>~7%</td>\n<td>poster 图片 preload + 视频懒加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背景图</td>\n<td>~3%</td>\n<td>preload + 内联关键 CSS 中的 <code>background-image</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LCP</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>TTFB</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Resource Load Delay</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Resource Load Duration</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Element Render Delay</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LCP} = \\text{TTFB} + \\text{Resource Load Delay} + \\text{Resource Load Duration} + \\text{Element Render Delay}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LCP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTFB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Resource Load Delay</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Resource Load Duration</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Element Render Delay</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每一段都有独立的优化手段，分段度量比只看总 LCP 值更有行动指导性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cls-防治策略\">CLS 防治策略</h2><p>CLS 的根因是<strong>未预留空间的异步内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>图片/视频：始终设置 <code>width</code> + <code>height</code> 属性（浏览器据此计算 aspect ratio）</li>\n<li>广告位/嵌入：固定尺寸容器预占位</li>\n<li>Web 字体：使用 <code>font-display: optional</code>（不换字体就没有 layout shift）或 <code>size-adjust</code> 匹配降级字体尺寸</li>\n<li>动态插入内容：只在视口<strong>下方</strong>插入，不在已渲染内容上方插入</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性集成-性能数据进入统一管道\">可观测性集成：性能数据进入统一管道</h2><p>Web Vitals 数据不应孤立于前端仪表盘。通过 OTel JS SDK 将性能指标作为 metric 信号导出到统一的可观测性管道：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>LCP/INP/CLS 作为 <code>gauge</code> 或 <code>histogram</code> 类型的 OTel metric</li>\n<li>每个度量附带 <code>page.url</code>、<code>device.type</code>、<code>connection.effective_type</code> 等 attribute</li>\n<li>在 Grafana 中与后端 API 延迟并排展示——前端 LCP 慢是因为 TTFB 慢（后端问题）还是 Resource Load 慢（CDN 问题）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于前端 RUM 的整体架构设计，参见 <a href=\"real-user-monitoring\">真实用户监控（RUM）</a>。前端 JS 错误对性能指标的影响及追踪方法，参见 <a href=\"frontend-error-tracking\">前端错误追踪</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Web Vitals 是用户感知体验的量化标准：LCP 度量加载、INP 度量交互、CLS 度量视觉稳定，三项均为排名信号且以 P75 Field 数据评估。INP 是 2026 年多数站点的失败点，它由 Input Delay、Processing Time、Presentation Delay 三段构成，每段都有对应的优化手段。度量的落地要点是：用 web-vitals attribution build 采集并归因、用 PerformanceObserver 采集 Long Animation Frames、用性能预算在 CI 中做回归守门。最终这些指标应通过 OTel JS SDK 进入统一管道，与后端延迟并排展示，从而判断“LCP 慢”到底源于后端 TTFB 还是 CDN 资源加载。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Web Vitals 与性能度量","id":"web-vitals-与性能度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Core Web Vitals 完整指标体系","id":"core-web-vitals-完整指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"INP 深度解析","id":"inp-深度解析"},{"level":2,"text":"性能度量的技术实现","id":"性能度量的技术实现"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 web-vitals 库采集","id":"使用-web-vitals-库采集"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 PerformanceObserver 自定义采集","id":"使用-performanceobserver-自定义采集"},{"level":2,"text":"性能预算与回归守门","id":"性能预算与回归守门"},{"level":2,"text":"LCP 优化实战清单","id":"lcp-优化实战清单"},{"level":2,"text":"CLS 防治策略","id":"cls-防治策略"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性集成：性能数据进入统一管道","id":"可观测性集成-性能数据进入统一管道"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"前端错误追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/frontend-client/frontend-error-tracking"},"next":{"title":"分布式追踪实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/fullstack-observability-practice/backend-infra/distributed-tracing-practice"}}